    {
      "subId": "7414213",
      "subQuestName": "与夏诺蒂拉对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741421301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741421301": {
            "id": "741421301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "#呜呜…谢谢你，{NICKNAME}{M#哥哥}{F#姐姐}…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421302"
            ]
          },
          "741421302": {
            "id": "741421302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "发生什么事了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421303"
            ]
          },
          "741421303": {
            "id": "741421303",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "我不知道…我只是想来看看开放的向日葵，还有可爱的小狗…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421304"
            ]
          },
          "741421304": {
            "id": "741421304",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "但在路上，突然出现了一个很可怕的怪物追我。同时，天变得越来越黑…而且有很多不同的声音，说我听不懂的东西…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421305"
            ]
          },
          "741421305": {
            "id": "741421305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "我害怕极了，就跟着金色的光，一直往前跑。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421306"
            ]
          },
          "741421306": {
            "id": "741421306",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "每当怪物接近我，整个世界就会变黑一点…花园、宫殿、大树和花朵都不见了，变得好阴暗，只剩下废墟…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421307"
            ]
          },
          "741421307": {
            "id": "741421307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "然后，怪物追上我…呜呜…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421308"
            ]
          },
          "741421308": {
            "id": "741421308",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "已经不用担心了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421309"
            ]
          },
          "741421309": {
            "id": "741421309",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "「小狗」，把她送回去吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421310"
            ]
          },
          "741421310": {
            "id": "741421310",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "小姐，别再来了。这里什么也没有，而外面还有一整个属于你的世界呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421311"
            ]
          },
          "741421311": {
            "id": "741421311",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "咦？你就是小狗吗…但是…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421312"
            ]
          },
          "741421312": {
            "id": "741421312",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "…我们还能再见面吗？这个世界还能变成美丽的花园吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421313"
            ]
          },
          "741421313": {
            "id": "741421313",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "不会的。再见了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421314"
            ]
          },
          "741421314": {
            "id": "741421314",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "还有你。我再问你一次，我在你眼里，到底是什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421315"
            ]
          },
          "741421315": {
            "id": "741421315",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "狗。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421316"
            ]
          },
          "741421316": {
            "id": "741421316",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "嗯，那就好。你已经赶走了不应该来到这里的人物，多亏了你，这个世界的崩解也停下了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421317"
            ]
          },
          "741421317": {
            "id": "741421317",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "但继续待在这里也是不明智的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421319",
              "741421321"
            ]
          },
          "741421319": {
            "id": "741421319",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "你很明智。那么别了。"
          },
          "741421321": {
            "id": "741421321",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "原本这里已经要彻底瓦解了。不该来到这里的人物到了这里，撼动了这个世界的根基。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421322"
            ]
          },
          "741421322": {
            "id": "741421322",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我所看到的现象，就是这么来的吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421323"
            ]
          },
          "741421323": {
            "id": "741421323",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "我不可能知道你体验过什么，毕竟我不是你。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421324"
            ]
          },
          "741421324": {
            "id": "741421324",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "那你又是谁？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421325"
            ]
          },
          "741421325": {
            "id": "741421325",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "…我是谁并不重要。重要的是这个妄想世界的主人。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421326"
            ]
          },
          "741421326": {
            "id": "741421326",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "他们相信他们能拯救世界，却不知道这个世界是否需要被拯救。或许他们记忆中的世界只不过是永远失去的向日葵盛开的午后。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421327"
            ]
          },
          "741421327": {
            "id": "741421327",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "但那些是他们的故事，不是我的故事。我只是他们对一位朋友的记忆。他们曾相信他们能拯救我，但最终…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421328"
            ]
          },
          "741421328": {
            "id": "741421328",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "蝶而化茧，茧破而幼虫出，最后幼虫走向未曾诞生的虚无。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421329"
            ]
          },
          "741421329": {
            "id": "741421329",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "不过这些都无所谓，因为现在的我已经什么都不剩下了。我只是他们的记忆中，对于「拯救我」这件事的执着所留下的影子。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421330"
            ]
          },
          "741421330": {
            "id": "741421330",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "但我也不会因此记恨他们，因为即使他们随着割舍而变化，这个记忆与妄想所构成的世界当中的我，仍然证明了他们的执着。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421331"
            ]
          },
          "741421331": {
            "id": "741421331",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "作为曾经的朋友，我很满足。无论我变成什么模样，我都会永远感念过去一起的友谊。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421332"
            ]
          },
          "741421332": {
            "id": "741421332",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "好了，就说到这吧。你也感受到了这里对你的影响吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421333"
            ]
          },
          "741421333": {
            "id": "741421333",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "「小狗」",
            "text": "别了。你和我不会再见。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7414215",
      "subQuestName": "苏醒",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741421501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741421501": {
            "id": "741421501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "「揭示之书」",
            "text": "（书页上的内容依旧是由无法理解的图形、字母与古语，以及几何图形构成。但集中精神后，似乎能渐渐理解其中的内容了。）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421502"
            ]
          },
          "741421502": {
            "id": "741421502",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}，还要进行「冥想」吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421503"
            ]
          },
          "741421503": {
            "id": "741421503",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "夏诺蒂拉还没找到。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421504"
            ]
          },
          "741421504": {
            "id": "741421504",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "这次也拜托你稍等我片刻。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421505"
            ]
          },
          "741421505": {
            "id": "741421505",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "唔…好吧！反正也就是一眨眼功夫的事情啦。我一点也不担心！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421506"
            ]
          },
          "741421506": {
            "id": "741421506",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#你要注意安全喔，{NICKNAME}。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7414214",
      "subQuestName": "与夏诺蒂拉对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "741421401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "741421401": {
            "id": "741421401",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哇！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421402"
            ]
          },
          "741421402": {
            "id": "741421402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "派蒙，我…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421403"
            ]
          },
          "741421403": {
            "id": "741421403",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这次也好快！我还来不及眨眼呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421404"
            ]
          },
          "741421404": {
            "id": "741421404",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "…那就好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421405"
            ]
          },
          "741421405": {
            "id": "741421405",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#好啦！罪魁祸首也回来啦，夏诺蒂拉，你害得{NICKNAME}好担心！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421406"
            ]
          },
          "741421406": {
            "id": "741421406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "我…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421407"
            ]
          },
          "741421407": {
            "id": "741421407",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "呜呜，对不起…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421408"
            ]
          },
          "741421408": {
            "id": "741421408",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哎？呃…我没有在责备你啦！夏诺蒂拉不哭，我给你吃好吃的…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421409"
            ]
          },
          "741421409": {
            "id": "741421409",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "（发生了什么呀？）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421410"
            ]
          },
          "741421410": {
            "id": "741421410",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（里面遇到了一些危险。）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421411"
            ]
          },
          "741421411": {
            "id": "741421411",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "（是喔…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421412"
            ]
          },
          "741421412": {
            "id": "741421412",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不哭不哭，夏诺蒂拉好勇敢！来，夏诺蒂拉，这是我最喜欢的野菇鸡肉串，给你做奖励！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421413"
            ]
          },
          "741421413": {
            "id": "741421413",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "呜呜…谢谢派蒙…嗯…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421414"
            ]
          },
          "741421414": {
            "id": "741421414",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "（咀嚼）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421415"
            ]
          },
          "741421415": {
            "id": "741421415",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "呜哇，好怪的味道，这就是人吃的饭吗…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421416"
            ]
          },
          "741421416": {
            "id": "741421416",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "什么嘛！你不吃那还给我！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421417"
            ]
          },
          "741421417": {
            "id": "741421417",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "#但是…谢谢派蒙。还有谢谢{NICKNAME}{M#哥哥}{F#姐姐}，谢谢你救了我。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421418"
            ]
          },
          "741421418": {
            "id": "741421418",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "之后有什么打算？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421419"
            ]
          },
          "741421419": {
            "id": "741421419",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "不知道，但我再也不想看书了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421420"
            ]
          },
          "741421420": {
            "id": "741421420",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "…夏诺蒂拉，这是否有点极端了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421421"
            ]
          },
          "741421421": {
            "id": "741421421",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "唔，但是「揭示之书」真的很可怕…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421422"
            ]
          },
          "741421422": {
            "id": "741421422",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "（所以到底发生了什么呀？）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421423"
            ]
          },
          "741421423": {
            "id": "741421423",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（很难解释…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421426"
            ]
          },
          "741421426": {
            "id": "741421426",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "（什么嘛！真气人…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421427"
            ]
          },
          "741421427": {
            "id": "741421427",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "…总之，我不要呆在这里了，我要和大家一起住在海沫村里。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421428"
            ]
          },
          "741421428": {
            "id": "741421428",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "那就对啦！别的美露莘会好好照顾你的！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "741421429"
            ]
          },
          "741421429": {
            "id": "741421429",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "夏诺蒂拉",
            "text": "#嗯。谢谢你们，{NICKNAME}{M#哥哥}{F#姐姐}、派蒙。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
